{"id":"d29e2baf343d2fd4","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-pair-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Pair Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-pair-closed-class — ZFC Pair Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pair-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pair-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-pair-closed-class — ZFC Pair Closed Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-ax-pair.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pair-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pair-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pair-closed-class — ZFC Pair Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b427958ee01d782e\" href=\"?note=b427958ee01d782e\" title=\"../batch16/58-ax-pair.md\">../batch16/58-ax-pair.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(C:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (unary class predicate in the ambient two-sorted metatheory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PairClosedClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PairClosedClass}_S\\)</span> (class-predicate schema defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pair\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{PairClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\bigl(C(x)\\land C(y)\\to C(\\{x,y\\})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pair\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{PairClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\bigl(C(x)\\land C(y)\\to C(\\{x,y\\})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a schema over a unary class predicate. It does not quantify over a proper class as though that class were a set-valued argument of an object-language predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-ax-pair.md","status":"resolved","id":"b427958ee01d782e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-ax-pair.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PairClosedClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pair\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{PairClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\bigl(C(x)\\land C(y)\\to C(\\{x,y\\})\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":873,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3025","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-pair-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-pair-closed-class]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","b427958ee01d782e"]}